 * WhatsApp Bot - Portfolio Architecture Showcase
 * Platform: Cloudflare Workers
 * Features:
 * - Omnichannel Architecture (WhatsApp API <-> Telegram Forums Handoff)
 * - State Machine & Memory via Cloudflare KV
